{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"The mender arrives a little behind the owl and looks at the building.  He pulls out his paints and goes to the corner of the building, and begins painting at the base, as the void takes shape, he quickly pulls a block of granite from his vest and sets it in place before the building has time to shift.","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:45:45.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878409501982724106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"he nods and steps back \"you are up\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:46:06.094000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878409589064892426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"bones writes into the foundation.\n``Thoughts and memories are both food and poison. The difference between whether they sustain or defeat you is in Veracity and Self Discipline. \"Is it true?\" and \"can I endure the truth of it? \"\nThoughts can be intelligence or base cunning. Memories can be wisdom or a prison. \nLet Veracity lead to Wisdom and Wisdom back to truth. Let us not be divided on the surety of either. Let your thoughts and memories cause others to rise as you rise. ``","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:50:47.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878410770180882452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"He sighs reflectively and etches into his sledge with a coin right beside it\n``accept what you've been given, and let go of what has been taken. Find yourself in your choices to build a foundation for a better tomorrow.``","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:51:07.045000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T22:52:58.341000Z","id":"878410851344855060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"As Bones writes, runes made of shadow, and glyphs made of light dance on the surface, moving up the walls of the building and down into the soil.  the more the writes the further the runes travel, and with the period at the end, the shadows turn to light, and the light to shadows before they fade.  Bones can see lines pointing to 3 of the 4 other boroughs.","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:54:24.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878411680307105823","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"You have work to do, but hopefully it feels good to have done that.  May this rebuild Kingsbridge\" he says","created_at":"2021-08-20T22:55:22.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878411924046479370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
